{"schema_version": 1, "segment_epoch": 1792466160, "covers_from": "2026-10-20T03:16:00+00:00", "covers_to": "2026-10-20T03:17:00+00:00", "next_epoch": 1792466220, "schedule": [{"starts_at": "2026-10-20T03:16:00+00:00", "duration_seconds": 14, "type": "padding", "queue_number": 67402, "sprite_key": "bear_suburb", "district": "wenshan", "topic": "勞工", "content": "如果，你擔任市長，勞工退休金（純舊制）會不會依據勞基法辦理？\n如果不會，勞工該怎麼辦？", "display_name": "文山代表 No.67,402", "mood": "worried", "is_replay": true}, {"starts_at": "2026-10-20T03:16:14+00:00", "duration_seconds": 15, "type": "padding", "queue_number": 50358, "sprite_key": "squirrel_business", "district": "neihu", "topic": "交通", "content": "我有個夢老舊公寓4樓都變16樓，人行道變寬有樹，住戶車都停到地下不挺路，車用道路變寬，就不會塞車了。", "display_name": "內湖代表 No.50,358", "mood": "caring", "is_replay": true}, {"starts_at": "2026-10-20T03:16:29+00:00", "duration_seconds": 6, "type": "padding", "queue_number": 22707, "sprite_key": "squirrel_business", "district": "neihu", "topic": "交通", "content": "請問如何解決內湖南港上下班塞車問題？", "display_name": "內湖代表 No.22,707", "mood": "helpless", "is_replay": true}, {"starts_at": "2026-10-20T03:16:35+00:00", "duration_seconds": 15, "type": "padding", "queue_number": 16703, "sprite_key": "penguin_culture", "district": "daan", "topic": "教育", "content": "營養午餐難吃到極點，孩子寧願只吃白飯，還要收廚餘費，簡直沒有針對源頭處理問題。與其免費，請提升質感。", "display_name": "大安代表 No.16,703", "mood": "angry", "is_replay": true}, {"starts_at": "2026-10-20T03:16:50+00:00", "duration_seconds": 10, "type": "padding", "queue_number": 10642, "sprite_key": "squirrel_suburb", "district": "beitou", "topic": "交通", "content": "拜託了，取消那個微罪不罰的低能政策，取消車種分流，嚴抓違停", "display_name": "北投代表 Willow", "mood": "angry", "is_replay": true}], "queue": [{"position": 1, "queue_number": 50358, "sprite_key": "squirrel_business", "display_name": "內湖代表 No.50,358", "district": "neihu", "is_replay": true, "frozen": true}, {"position": 2, "queue_number": 22707, "sprite_key": "squirrel_business", "display_name": "內湖代表 No.22,707", "district": "neihu", "is_